# Storage Task

Task: Using the disk `{{target_disk}}`, create a physical volume and the volume group `{{vg_name}}`. In it, create the logical volume `{{lv_name}}` with a size of `{{lv_size_mib}} MiB`.

Format the logical volume with `{{filesystem}}`, mount it at `{{mount_point}}`, and ensure the mount is restored automatically after the system reboots. Do not modify any other disks.
